# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit a filled-in copy.
#
# HTTPS endpoint that accepts the lead form as multipart/form-data.
# NOT YET IMPLEMENTED — while this is unset the form validates normally but
# shows "online submission is not available yet" and points visitors at the
# direct contact details. Nothing is uploaded anywhere.
#
# Read docs/backend-requirements.md before pointing this at anything:
# uploaded energy bills contain account numbers, service addresses and usage
# history, and the server must re-run every validation the client does.
VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=
